### AUDIO GENERATION STRATEGY

For each translated segment:

Input:
- text
- start time
- end time

Compute:
target_duration = end - start

Process:

1) Generate raw TTS audio → seg_X_raw.wav
2) Measure duration (ffprobe)
3) If mismatch >15%:
     apply time-stretch (ffmpeg atempo)
4) If too short:
     pad silence
5) Save final → seg_X.wav

Clamp tempo to [0.85, 1.15]

Never distort more than that.

